32\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me whether Grindeth Pendacre's birthday is coming up soon?\", \"Thank you. And what about Flanis Gradwell's?\"], [\"umm is Grindeth Pendacre's birthday… is that coming up soon?\", \"oh ok, and uh… Flanis Gradwell's?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0033\", \"v\": [[\"I lent a few people money over the summer and lost track of it all, so does Emiliano Gradwell actually owe me anything at the moment?\", \"oh wait, before I forget, I'm trying to remember who all came along, can you show me who's in the Hastings trip group?\", \"actually never mind that, it doesn't matter right now\"], [\"Emiliano Gradwell owe me?\", \"hang on, Hastings trip members?\", \"never mind\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0034\", \"v\": [[\"I need to send my optician a quick question about my new lenses, so could you dig out the email address for Levix Opticians for me?\", \"different thing — I feel like I've been letting stuff slide lately, so what have I got that's overdue?\", \"that's a bit overwhelming, can you just show me the ones from last week so I can tackle those first?\", \"totally unrelated, but I'm putting together a little slideshow for the weekend, so could you pull up the photos I've marked as favourites?\"], [\"whats the email for Levix Opticians\", \"diff thing, whats overdue\", \"just the ones from last week pls\", \"oh and show me my fave pics\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0035\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you… settle up with Tealine in the capoeira syndicate?\", \"ok different thing, what birthdays or, uh, anniversaries have I got next week?\", \"oh hang on, quick one, what's Javier Yoshida's email address?\", \"right, uh, can you show me my to-dos about the poncho?\", \"ah actually, forget it\", \"ok so… who's gonna be at the pick?\"], [\"settle up with Tealine in capoeira syndicate pls\", \"any bdays or anniversaries next week\", \"wait quick one whats Javier Yoshida's email\", \"oh and my to-dos about poncho?\", \"eh forget it\", \"who'll be at the pick\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0036\", \"v\": [[\"add forty dollars for Tealine's lunch to capoeira syndicate, i paid\", \"is Thierry's birthday comin up?\", \"diff thing, put the trogir pier pic in the Barge progress album pls\", \"where was it taken\", \"actually dont bother\"], [\"Could you please add forty dollars for Tealine's lunch to the capoeira syndicate? I paid for it.\", \"On another note, could you tell me whether Thierry's birthday is coming up?\", \"Would you mind putting the trogir pier photo into the Barge progress album, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me where it was taken?\", \"Actually, please don't bother, that's fine.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0037\", \"v\": [[\"umm what jobs have I got on my list that take, like, an hour?\", \"ok so tick off the first one and, uh, delete the second one\", \"oh and, the cherrywood task, that's done now\", \"no wait, wrong one, I meant the Agatha one\", \"ok different thing, what important dates are there next month?\", \"hmm, can you narrow that to just, uh, anything about Postett?\"], [\"Could you show me the tasks on my list that take an hour?\", \"Please mark the first one as done and delete the second one.\", \"On a separate matter, I've finished the cherrywood task, so please mark it complete.\", \"I'm sorry, that was the wrong task. I meant the Agatha one.\", \"Could you tell me which important dates fall next month?\", \"Would you mind narrowing that down to anything about Postett?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0038\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how many tasks I had due last month?\", \"Thank you. Could you please find the capoeira voucher for me?\", \"One more thing: what is Drondel Greenhalgh's balance with me in the Hastings trip group?\"], [\"I'm doing a bit of a monthly review to see how I'm keeping up, so how many tasks did I have due last month?\", \"separate thing, I think I've got a class coming up and want to use it, can you find the capoeira voucher for me?\", \"and I'm trying to square up the money from the holiday, so what's the balance between me and Drondel Greenhalgh in the Hastings trip group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0039\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me which tasks were due last month?\", \"Thank you. Could you please add a task for tuesday to book the sonock service?\", \"On another matter, how much does Dythine owe me in Hastings?\", \"Actually, please forget it.\"], [\"umm which tasks did I have due, uh, last month?\", \"ok different thing, tuesday, can you add a task to book the sonock service\", \"oh and how much does Dythine owe me, in Hastings?\", \"ah, forget it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0040\", \"v\": [[\"umm what documents have I got, like, linked to Temmere Leisure Centre?\", \"ok different thing, what's… Grindeth Postett's mobile number?\", \"nah, leave it\", \"right, uh, what have I got filed under Capoeira?\", \"and which of those are, um, about tax?\"], [\"what docs are linked to Temmere Leisure Centre\", \"whats Grindeth Postett's mobile\", \"nah leave it\", \"what have i got filed under Capoeira\", \"which of those r about tax\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0041\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please move both the Cobohaven task and the Cobohaven calendar entry to friday?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me how many items I have saved in my locker?\", \"On another note, who did I have coffee with last monday?\", \"Actually, please forget it.\"], [\"move both Cobohaven things, the task and the event, to friday\", \"how many things have i got in the locker\", \"who did i have coffee with last monday\", \"eh forget it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0042\", \"v\": [[\"which group is the hastings repair expense in\", \"Could you tell me the login for the philately meetup membership, please? I don't need the password, just the username.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0043\", \"v\": [[\"latest diary entry?\", \"barge events?\", \"what about gravy?\"], [\"umm what was my, uh, latest journal entry?\", \"ok so can you find the, um, calendar events on barge?\", \"oh and what about gravy?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0044\", \"v\": [[\"